  <desc>Which invoice, payment or other document made a ledger entry.</desc>
    <credit type="author">
      <name>Reuben Rissler</name>
      <email>pygtk.posting@gmail.com</email>
    </credit>
  </info>

  <title>GL entry lookup</title>

  <p>Select entries in <link xref="account_transactions"/> and choose
  <gui>GL entry lookup</gui> from its menu. This window searches every kind of
  document for the ones that made those entries, and lists each with its
  <gui>Type</gui>, <gui>Number</gui>, <gui>Contact</gui> and <gui>Date</gui>.</p>

  <p>Double click a document, or right click it and choose <gui>Open source
  document</gui>, to open it: an invoice in the <link xref="invoice_hub"/>, a
  purchase order in the <link xref="purchase_order_hub">PO hub</link>, and so
  on. <gui>Edit GL transaction</gui> opens <link xref="edit_gl_entry"/> after
  asking for the administrator password.</p>

</page>
